    {
      "schema_version": 6,
      "book_id": "2TI",
      "chapter": 2,
      "chapter_usfm": "2TI.2",
      "version_id": 3034,
      "version_abbr": "BSB",
      "verses": [
        {
          "verse": 1,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.1",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "You therefore, my child, be strong in the grace that is in Christ Jesus."
        },
        {
          "verse": 2,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.2",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "And the things that you have heard me say among many witnesses, entrust these to faithful men who will be qualified to teach others as well."
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.3",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Join me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus."
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.4",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "A soldier refrains from entangling himself in civilian affairs, in order to please the one who enlisted him."
        },
        {
          "verse": 5,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.5",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Likewise, a competitor does not receive the crown unless he competes according to the rules."
        },
        {
          "verse": 6,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.6",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "The hardworking farmer should be the first to partake of the crops."
        },
        {
          "verse": 7,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.7",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Consider what I am saying, for the Lord will give you insight into all things."
        },
        {
          "verse": 8,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.8",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Remember Jesus Christ, raised from the dead, descended from David, as proclaimed by my gospel,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 9,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.9",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "for which I suffer to the extent of being chained like a criminal. But the word of God cannot be chained!"
        },
        {
          "verse": 10,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.10",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For this reason I endure all things for the sake of the elect, so that they too may obtain the salvation that is in Christ Jesus, with eternal glory."
        },
        {
          "verse": 11,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.11",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "This is a trustworthy saying:If we died with Him,we will also live with Him;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.12",
          "line_type": "q1",
          "text": "if we endure,we will also reign with Him;if we deny Him,He will also deny us;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 13,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.13",
          "line_type": "q1",
          "text": "if we are faithless,He remains faithful,for He cannot deny Himself."
        },
        {
          "verse": 14,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.14",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Remind the believers of these things, charging them before God to avoid quarreling over words, which succeeds only in leading the listeners to ruin."
        },
        {
          "verse": 15,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.15",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Make every effort to present yourself approved to God, an unashamed workman who accurately handles the word of truth."
        },
        {
          "verse": 16,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.16",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But avoid irreverent, empty chatter, which will only lead to more ungodliness,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 17,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.17",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "and the talk of such men will spread like gangrene. Among them are Hymenaeus and Philetus,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 18,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.18",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "who have deviated from the truth. They say that the resurrection has already occurred, and they undermine the faith of some."
        },
        {
          "verse": 19,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.19",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Nevertheless, God’s firm foundation stands, bearing this seal: “The Lord knows those who are His,” and, “Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord must turn away from iniquity.”"
        },
        {
          "verse": 20,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.20",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "A large house contains not only vessels of gold and silver, but also of wood and clay. Some indeed are for honorable use, but others are for common use."
        },
        {
          "verse": 21,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.21",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "So if anyone cleanses himself of what is unfit, he will be a vessel for honor: sanctified, useful to the Master, and prepared for every good work."
        },
        {
          "verse": 22,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.22",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Flee from youthful passions and pursue righteousness, faith, love, and peace, together with those who call on the Lord out of a pure heart."
        },
        {
          "verse": 23,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.23",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But reject foolish and ignorant speculation, for you know that it breeds quarreling."
        },
        {
          "verse": 24,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.24",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "And a servant of the Lord must not be quarrelsome, but must be kind to everyone, able to teach, and forbearing."
        },
        {
          "verse": 25,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.25",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "He must gently reprove those who oppose him, in the hope that God may grant them repentance leading to a knowledge of the truth."
        },
        {
          "verse": 26,
          "usfm": "2TI.2.26",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Then they will come to their senses and escape the snare of the devil, who has taken them captive to his will."
        }
      ],
      "verse_count": 26,
      "headings": [
        {
          "before_verse": 14,
          "text": "The Lord’s Approved Workman"
        }
      ],
